Package: roottrace-collector
Version: __VERSION__-__RELEASE__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), systemd, adduser
Recommends: acl, python3-psycopg2, python3-pymongo
Maintainer: RootTrace <support@roottrace.io>
Homepage: https://roottrace.io/docs/collector/
Description: RootTrace read-only diagnostics collector
 Outbound-only, read-only diagnostics collector for RootTrace. Sends
 heartbeats and diagnostics to the RootTrace API over short-lived HTTPS
 requests; opens no inbound ports, executes no remediation, and mutates
 no customer configuration.
 .
 Configure /etc/roottrace/collector.env, run
 roottrace-collector-setup apply, then enable
 roottrace-collector.service. Shipped as plain Python source: what runs
 on the host is byte-identical to what an auditor reads.
